  <div class="w-embed"></div><div class="hero3" style="opacity:0"><div class="hero-image-wrapper"><img alt="" class="hero-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-22b8daa3a98de1.jpg"/></div><div class="hero-image-overlay"></div><div class="hero-content-wrapper"><div class="hero-content" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1.01, 1.01, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0"><div class="subtitle light">Suite Cabanat</div><h1 class="light">She gracefully lay down in the cabana. "I'm not moving till sunset", she affirmed.</h1></div></div></div><div class="room-subhero-section"><div class="container"><div class="banner"><div class="collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div class="banner-collection-list w-dyn-items w-row" role="list"><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 96vw, (max-width: 767px) 97vw, (max-width: 991px) 31vw, (max-width: 1919px) 32vw, 33vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-ae27418e5ad647.png"/><p class="faq-question-title">Outdoor Shower</p></div></div><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-e6bebc1b9218e6.png"/><p class="faq-question-title">Valley View</p></div></div><div class="banner-collection-item w-dyn-item w-col w-col-4" role="listitem"><div class="room-amenity-wrapper"><img alt="" class="room-amenity-icon" loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/page-img-f0a9933b3d627f.png"/><p class="faq-question-title">Sun bed Cabana</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section bottom-padding-192"><div class="container"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-halves"><div class="main-content"><p class="feature-paragraph smaller">Deluxe King Suite with outdoor shower and sun cabanat - 2 people max - 55m2</p><h3>Suite Cabanat</h3><p>Our generous Suite Cabanat is a split-level affair (due to its position on a slope) with the sumptuous bedroom on the 1st floor opening up to a terrace with an outdoor shower. It features both a walk-in shower and a bath. The living room level boats a private garden with a sunbed cabana. </p><p class="italics">Choose this one if you want lots of outdoor space to bask in the Mediterranean sun. The original room layout is adored by architects.</p><div class="btn-wrapper"><a class="button w-button" href="https://app.mews.com/distributor/150bd326-7c63-4a24-b668-abcf00c6bb22" target="_blank">Check Now</a></div></div><div class="secondary-content"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-items w-row" role="list"><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Bath tub</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Luxury bedding</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Bluetooth radio</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Air Conditioning</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Espresso machine</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Free toiletries</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Free WiFi</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Garden View</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Hair dryer</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">King-Size bed</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Bathrobes</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Minibar</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Outdoor furniture</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Outdoor area</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Refrigerator</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Satellite channels</p></div></div><div class="w-dyn-item w-col w-col-6" role="listitem"><div><p class="feature-paragraph">Walk-in Shower</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section no-top-padding"><div class="full-frame-slider-wrapper"><div class="full-frame-slider w-slider" data-animation="cross" data-autoplay="true" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-delay="4000" data-disable-swipe="false" data-duration="500" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-infinite="true" data-nav-spacing="3"><div class="slider-mask w-slider-mask"><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-eecc3519b1d474.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/images/page-img-2da7f75b95faa5.jpg"/></div></div><div class="w-slide"><div class="full-frame-single-slide-wrapper"><img alt="" class="full-frame-single-slide-image" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw"